    {"id":"editorial-09e8f75c482f-original","group":"editorial-09e8f75c482f","text":"TTiTTulares · 21/09/2026 · 4/14 · ABC, El Mundo, Europa Press, elDiario.es\n\nLa Agencia Tributaria intercepta un velero con más de 2.000 kilos de cocaína a 400 millas de Galicia. El Petrel I lo trasladó al puerto de Vigo y sus tripulantes fueron detenidos.","buttons":[[{"text":"PUBLICAR ORIGINAL","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=La%20Agencia%20Tributaria%20intercepta%20un%20velero%20con%20m%C3%A1s%20de%202.000%20kilos%20de%20coca%C3%ADna%20a%20400%20millas%20de%20Galicia.%20El%20Petrel%20I%20lo%20traslad%C3%B3%20al%20puerto%20de%20Vigo%20y%20sus%20tripulantes%20fueron%20detenidos."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-09e8f75c482f-a","group":"editorial-09e8f75c482f","text":"🌶️ A) Dos toneladas de cocaína y un velero: el Atlántico venía con exceso de equipaje.","buttons":[[{"text":"PUBLICAR A","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=La%20Agencia%20Tributaria%20intercepta%20un%20velero%20con%20m%C3%A1s%20de%202.000%20kilos%20de%20coca%C3%ADna%20a%20400%20millas%20de%20Galicia.%20El%20Petrel%20I%20lo%20traslad%C3%B3%20al%20puerto%20de%20Vigo%20y%20sus%20tripulantes%20fueron%20detenidos.%20Dos%20toneladas%20de%20coca%C3%ADna%20y%20un%20velero%3A%20el%20Atl%C3%A1ntico%20ven%C3%ADa%20con%20exceso%20de%20equipaje."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-09e8f75c482f-b","group":"editorial-09e8f75c482f","text":"🌶️ B) A 400 millas de Galicia y aun así acabaron atracando en Vigo. No era precisamente turismo náutico.","buttons":[[{"text":"PUBLICAR B","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=La%20Agencia%20Tributaria%20intercepta%20un%20velero%20con%20m%C3%A1s%20de%202.000%20kilos%20de%20coca%C3%ADna%20a%20400%20millas%20de%20Galicia.%20El%20Petrel%20I%20lo%20traslad%C3%B3%20al%20puerto%20de%20Vigo%20y%20sus%20tripulantes%20fueron%20detenidos.%20A%20400%20millas%20de%20Galicia%20y%20aun%20as%C3%AD%20acabaron%20atracando%20en%20Vigo.%20No%20era%20precisamente%20turismo%20n%C3%A1utico."}]]},
    {"id":"editorial-09e8f75c482f-c","group":"editorial-09e8f75c482f","text":"🌶️ C) El Petrel I encontró más de 2.000 kilos. No era precisamente un crucero con todo incluido.","buttons":[[{"text":"PUBLICAR C","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=La%20Agencia%20Tributaria%20intercepta%20un%20velero%20con%20m%C3%A1s%20de%202.000%20kilos%20de%20coca%C3%ADna%20a%20400%20millas%20de%20Galicia.%20El%20Petrel%20I%20lo%20traslad%C3%B3%20al%20puerto%20de%20Vigo%20y%20sus%20tripulantes%20fueron%20detenidos.%20El%20Petrel%20I%20encontr%C3%B3%20m%C3%A1s%20de%202.000%20kilos.%20No%20era%20precisamente%20un%20crucero%20con%20todo%20incluido."}]]}
